STRUKTURA v1.0.0 product scope:
  - Product identity, dashboard and project management (localStorage,
    versioned JSON import/export, model fingerprinting).
  - Sample project set (7 verified samples) and an analytical benchmark
    suite (benchmarks/) plus unit tests (tests/) that did not exist upstream.
  - SNI 1727:2020 Pasal 2.3.2 load-combination preset.
  - Calculation report generator (print/PDF HTML) from real solver results.
  - GitHub Pages hosting configuration (Vite base path + workflow).
  - Documentation set under docs/.

The Direct Stiffness Method, Euler-Bernoulli beam theory and the cited
SNI/ACI/AISC code formulas are standard engineering methods and published
code provisions; formula implementations carry clause references in-source.

No other third-party code is vendored. Runtime dependencies and their
licenses are listed in docs/LICENSING_AUDIT.md.
